<h2>Booking Request Received</h2>

<p>Hello <%= @customer.user.name %>,</p>

<p>Your booking request for <strong><%= @service.name %></strong> with <strong><%= @vendor.business_name %></strong> has been received and is pending vendor confirmation.</p>

<div class="details-card">
  <h3>Booking Details</h3>
  <ul class="details-list">
    <li><strong>Service:</strong> <%= @service.name %></li>
    <li><strong>Vendor:</strong> <%= @vendor.business_name %></li>
    <li><strong>Date & Time:</strong> <%= format_booking_time(@booking) %></li>
    <li><strong>Location:</strong> <%= @booking.event_location %></li>
    <li><strong>Total Amount:</strong> ₹<%= number_with_precision(@booking.total_amount, precision: 2) %></li>
    <li><strong>Status:</strong> <%= @booking.status.titleize %></li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="button-container">
  <a href="<%= @view_booking_url %>" class="button">View Booking Details</a>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">The vendor will review your request shortly. You will receive an email as soon as they confirm.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>
<strong>The Ayoj Team</strong></p>
